Visual style: Swiss Motion Graphics principles from lemo-opuscar (MIT License), https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar. Used as a style and rendering toolkit; all film layouts and animation code in this folder are original.

Font: Rubik Project Authors; SIL Open Font License 1.1. Source: https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Rubik. The font files are supplied by the Tunisiska Services project; license text is included in `assets/fonts/OFL.txt`.

App interface and brand: provided by the user in the Tunisiska Mega store-ready screenshot kit and video package. Used as authorized by the user. The Swedish services screen is cropped from StoreReady-iOS/09-services.png. The Arabic services screen is cropped from the earlier safe Arabic UI capture. Logo supplied by the user.

Music and sound: original procedural synthesis for this film; no third-party samples.

No geographic map, stock image, footage, or external music is used.
